<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>AI Visibility Audit — {{ business_name }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: Letter; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Inter", "Segoe UI", Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #0f172a; background: #fafafa; }

  /* Page primitives — only cover & CTA get fixed full-page height. Others flow. */
  .page { width: 8.5in; padding: 0.55in 0.7in 0.65in; position: relative; background: #fafafa; }
  .page-cover, .page-cta { min-height: 11in; page-break-after: always; }
  .page-break { page-break-before: always; }

  /* Typography */
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
  h2 { font-size: 19pt; line-height: 1.2; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 3pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; }
  h3 { font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.3; }
  h4 { font-size: 9pt; margin: 0 0 5pt; color: #5f7ea6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2pt; font-weight: 700; }
  p  { margin: 0 0 10pt; line-height: 1.55; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #334155; }
  .muted    { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 10pt; }
  .subtitle { color: #64748b; font-size: 10.5pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; }

  /* Cover */
  .page-cover { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding-top: 0.65in; padding-bottom: 0.65in; }
  .cover-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .cover-top .logo { max-width: 96px; max-height: 60px; object-fit: contain; }
  .cover-top .logo-fallback { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; }
  .cover-top .wordmark { font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; color: #5f7ea6; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }

  .cover-hero { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; max-width: 6.4in; padding: 0; }
  .cover-hero .eyebrow { font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 3pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5f7ea6; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .cover-hero .name { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 38pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 4pt; line-height: 1.05; word-break: break-word; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -1pt; }
  .cover-hero .date { font-size: 11pt; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 26pt; }
  .cover-hero .hook { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 24pt; line-height: 1.2; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10pt; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; }
  .cover-hero .sub { font-size: 12pt; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 22pt; max-width: 5.5in; }

  .cover-bar { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 18pt 16pt; margin-top: 0; }
  .cover-bar .label-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6pt; font-weight: 600; }
  .cover-bar .label-row .right { color: #b91c1c; }
  .cover-bar .stripe { height: 12pt; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 6pt; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
  .cover-bar .stripe .own { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5f7ea6 0%, #4a6a90 100%); border-radius: 6pt 0 0 6pt; }
  .cover-bar .stripe-legend { display: flex; gap: 14pt; font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 8pt; }
  .cover-bar .stripe-legend .dot { display: inline-block; width: 8pt; height: 8pt; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 5pt; vertical-align: middle; }
  .cover-bar .stripe-legend .dot-own { background: #5f7ea6; }
  .cover-bar .stripe-legend .dot-missing { background: #e2e8f0; }

  .cover-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 10pt; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 9pt; color: #94a3b8; }

  /* Pills */
  .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 2pt 10pt; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pill-loss        { background: #fef2f2; color: #b91c1c; }
  .pill-untapped    { background: #fffbeb; color: #b45309; }
  .pill-tied        { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
  .pill-lead        { background: #f0fdf4; color: #16a34a; }
  .pill-uncontested { background: #ecfdf5; color: #059669; }

  /* Executive summary */
  .lede-block { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left: 3pt solid #5f7ea6; padding: 12pt 16pt; margin: 0 0 18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.55; color: #0f172a; border-radius: 6px; }
  .lede-block strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .score-row { display: flex; gap: 10pt; margin: 0 0 14pt; }
  .score-card { flex: 1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12pt 14pt 14pt; }
  .score-card .label { font-size: 8.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.4pt; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .score-card .value-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6pt; }
  .score-card .value { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 30pt; line-height: 1; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -1pt; }
  .score-card .caption { font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 6pt; line-height: 1.4; }
  .score-card.is-gap .value { color: #b45309; }
  .score-bar { height: 5pt; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 3pt; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 10pt; }
  .score-bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; }
  .score-bar.own > span    { background: #5f7ea6; }
  .score-bar.peer > span   { background: #94a3b8; }
  .score-bar.miss > span   { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b, #d97706); }
  .peer-line { font-size: 10pt; color: #475569; margin: 4pt 0 18pt; }
  .methodology { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.55; margin-top: 16pt; padding-top: 10pt; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }

  /* Per-prompt scorecard */
  .prompt-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9pt 12pt 10pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .prompt-card.kind-loss        { border-left: 3pt solid #b91c1c; }
  .prompt-card.kind-untapped    { border-left: 3pt solid #b45309; }
  .prompt-card.kind-tied        { border-left: 3pt solid #94a3b8; }
  .prompt-card.kind-lead        { border-left: 3pt solid #16a34a; }
  .prompt-card.kind-uncontested { border-left: 3pt solid #059669; }
  .prompt-card .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  .prompt-card .q { font-style: italic; color: #0f172a; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.35; flex: 1; }
  .bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8pt; margin: 2pt 0; font-size: 9pt; }
  .bar-row .bar-label { width: 50pt; color: #64748b; }
  .bar-row .bar { flex: 1; height: 7pt; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar-row .bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; }
  .bar-row .pct { width: 34pt; text-align: right; color: #334155; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 600; }
  .bar-own > span  { background: #5f7ea6; }
  .bar-peer > span { background: #cbd5e1; }

  /* Action blocks */
  .action-block { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 18pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .action-block.kind-loss        { border-left: 4pt solid #b91c1c; }
  .action-block.kind-untapped    { border-left: 4pt solid #b45309; }
  .action-block.kind-uncontested { border-left: 4pt solid #059669; }
  .action-block.kind-tied        { border-left: 4pt solid #94a3b8; }
  .action-block.kind-lead        { border-left: 4pt solid #16a34a; }
  .action-block .q { font-style: italic; color: #475569; font-size: 9.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .action-block .punch { font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 1.45; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  .action-block .punch strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .action-block .why { font-size: 9.5pt; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; }

  /* Recommendations */
  .recs { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 20pt 8pt; }
  .recs ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 22pt; }
  .recs ol li { font-size: 10.25pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 10pt; padding-left: 4pt; }
  .recs ol li:last-child { margin-bottom: 4pt; }
  .recs strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }
  .recs p { margin: 3pt 0; }
  .static-fallback { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 20pt; }
  .static-fallback ul { margin: 6pt 0; padding-left: 20pt; }
  .static-fallback li { margin-bottom: 5pt; font-size: 10.25pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155; }

  /* CTA page */
  .page-cta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding-top: 0.65in; padding-bottom: 0.65in; }
  .cta-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .cta-top .wordmark { font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; color: #5f7ea6; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
  .cta-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; padding-top: 26pt; }
  .cta-content .eyebrow { font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 3pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5f7ea6; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .cta-content .hook { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 28pt; line-height: 1.15; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; }
  .cta-content .body { font-size: 11pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 22pt; max-width: 6in; }
  .cta-content .body strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }

  .two-col { display: flex; gap: 12pt; margin-bottom: 18pt; }
  .col-block { flex: 1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 16pt 12pt; }
  .col-block .col-title { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; color: #5f7ea6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; padding-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  .col-block ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 14pt; }
  .col-block li { font-size: 9.75pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .col-block li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .col-block li strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }

  .platform-pill { display: inline-block; padding: 4pt 12pt; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 9pt; color: #5f7ea6; background: #eef2f6; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14pt; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; }

  .cta-action { background: #0f172a; color: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18pt 22pt; margin-top: 0; }
  .cta-action .ask { font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12pt; color: #fff; }
  .cta-action .ask strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
  .cta-action .links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5pt; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .cta-action .links a { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; }
  .cta-action .links a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .cta-action .links .label { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 9pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; margin-right: 6pt; }

  .cta-footer { font-size: 9pt; color: #94a3b8; padding-top: 12pt; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 22pt; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .cta-footer .who { font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────── COVER ───────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-cover">
  <div class="cover-top">
    {% if logo_data_uri %}
      <img src="{{ logo_data_uri }}" class="logo" alt="{{ business_name }}" />
    {% else %}
      <div class="logo-fallback">{{ business_name }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="wordmark">Lumidian</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">AI Visibility Audit</div>
    <div class="name">{{ business_name }}</div>
    <div class="date">{{ audit_month }}{% if location %} · {{ location }}{% endif %}</div>

    <div class="hook">{{ cover_hook }}</div>
    <div class="sub">{{ cover_sub }}</div>

    <div class="cover-bar">
      <div class="label-row">
        <span>Share of relevant AI searches mentioning {{ business_name }}</span>
        <span class="right">{{ missing_pct|round|int }}% missing</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stripe">
        <div class="own" style="width: {{ overall_visibility_pct }}%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stripe-legend">
        <span><span class="dot dot-own"></span>You mentioned · {{ overall_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</span>
        <span><span class="dot dot-missing"></span>Searches without you · {{ missing_pct|round|int }}%</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-meta">
    <div>Prepared by Lumidian</div>
    <div>{{ generated_label }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────── EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ─────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page">
  <h4>Executive Summary</h4>
  <h2>Where {{ business_name }} stands on AI search</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">90 queries to ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini — questions a real customer would ask.</div>

  <div class="lede-block">{{ summary_lead }}</div>

  <div class="score-row">
    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="label">Your Visibility</div>
      <div class="value-row"><div class="value">{{ overall_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div></div>
      <div class="score-bar own"><span style="width: {{ overall_visibility_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="caption">of relevant AI responses mention you</div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="label">Peer Average</div>
      <div class="value-row"><div class="value">{{ peer_avg_overall|round|int }}%</div></div>
      <div class="score-bar peer"><span style="width: {{ peer_avg_overall }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="caption">competitors averaged this across the same prompts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-card is-gap">
      <div class="label">Searches Missing You</div>
      <div class="value-row"><div class="value">{{ missing_pct|round|int }}%</div></div>
      <div class="score-bar miss"><span style="width: {{ missing_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="caption">of potential customers don't hear your name</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="peer-line">Your peer group: <strong>{{ peer_names_joined }}</strong>.</div>

  <p class="methodology">
    <strong>Methodology:</strong> 10 generated prompts × 3 models (ChatGPT search, Perplexity Sonar-Pro, Gemini 2.5 Flash) × 3 runs = 90 queries total. Visibility = the share of those queries where {{ business_name }} appeared in the response. Generated {{ generated_label }}.
  </p>
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── PER-PROMPT SCORECARD ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>Per-prompt breakdown</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">All 10 prompts, sorted by what needs your attention first.</div>

  {% for ps in scorecard %}
  <div class="prompt-card kind-{{ ps.kind }}">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="q">"{{ ps.prompt_text }}"</div>
      <span class="pill pill-{{ ps.kind }}">
        {% if ps.kind == 'loss' %}LOSING
        {% elif ps.kind == 'untapped' %}UNTAPPED
        {% elif ps.kind == 'tied' %}TIED
        {% elif ps.kind == 'lead' %}AHEAD
        {% else %}UNCONTESTED{% endif %}
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="bar-row bar-own">
      <div class="bar-label">You</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: {{ ps.own_visibility_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="pct">{{ ps.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bar-row bar-peer">
      <div class="bar-label">Peers</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: {{ ps.peer_avg_visibility_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="pct">{{ ps.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── WHERE TO ACT ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>Where to focus first</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">Three prompts that show the full picture — what to fix, what to capture, what to defend.</div>

  {% for w in action_blocks %}
  <div class="action-block kind-{{ w.kind }}">
    <div class="q">"{{ w.prompt_text }}"</div>

    <div class="punch">
      {% if w.kind == 'loss' and w.top_competitor_name %}
        <strong>{{ w.top_competitor_name }}</strong> dominates this question with <strong>{{ w.top_competitor_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> visibility — you're at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>.
      {% elif w.kind == 'loss' %}
        Competitors collectively appear in <strong>{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> of responses — you're at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>.
      {% elif w.kind == 'untapped' %}
        {% if w.variant_index == 0 %}
          Nobody surfaces here yet — not you, not your peers. Whoever publishes first owns this question in AI search.
        {% elif w.variant_index == 1 %}
          Another open category: zero competitor content, zero from you. AI models default to generic answers because no source is authoritative.
        {% else %}
          A third clear opening — this query has no clear winner in {{ location or "your market" }}, just placeholder text from AI models.
        {% endif %}
      {% elif w.kind == 'uncontested' %}
        Only you appear in responses to this — peers are at <strong>0%</strong>. A fragile lead worth defending with more content.
      {% elif w.kind == 'tied' %}
        You and competitors are tied at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. A small content push pulls you clear.
      {% else %}
        You're ahead at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> vs peers at <strong>{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. Defend and widen.
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="why">
      {% if w.kind == 'loss' %}
        {% if w.variant_index == 0 %}
          AI models are pulling from competitor content. Closing the gap means publishing on the same surfaces being cited — LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora.
        {% else %}
          Same playbook: match where the competitor is being cited from, not just on your own domain.
        {% endif %}
      {% elif w.kind == 'untapped' %}
        {% if w.variant_index == 0 %}
          A single well-structured long-form piece can become THE citation across all three models. First mover wins.
        {% elif w.variant_index == 1 %}
          Different topic, same dynamic — one detailed answer published on the right surfaces becomes the default citation.
        {% else %}
          Pattern is consistent across these openings: zero competitor presence means low effort to dominate.
        {% endif %}
      {% elif w.kind == 'uncontested' %}
        The position is real but fragile — any competitor publishing one strong piece could flip the citation.
      {% else %}
        Maintain the lead with regular updates and structured schema so AI models keep citing you.
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── RECOMMENDATIONS ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>What we'd do about it</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">3–5 recommendations, ranked by impact.</div>

  {% if recommendations_html %}
    <div class="recs">{{ recommendations_html|safe }}</div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="static-fallback">
      <p>Lumidian closes AI visibility gaps with a recurring monthly playbook:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>12+ AI-optimized articles every month</strong> — distributed across LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora, and X as coordinated content clusters.</li>
        <li><strong>YouTube video AI-readability optimization</strong> — we restructure descriptions, captions, and chapters so models can extract from your videos.</li>
        <li><strong>Website AI-readability audit</strong> — a one-time engagement to diagnose schema, structure, and citation surfaces. (Future work, not yet performed.)</li>
        <li><strong>Live tracking dashboard</strong> across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini.</li>
        <li><strong>Competitor monitoring</strong> — flagged within days when a peer publishes AI-citable content in your category.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── CTA ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-cta page-break">
  <div class="cta-top">
    <div></div>
    <div class="wordmark">Lumidian</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Next step</div>
    <div class="hook">Ready to close the {{ missing_pct|round|int }}% gap?</div>

    <div class="platform-pill">Software · or done-for-you</div>
    <div class="body">
      Lumidian is the AI visibility platform — a tracking dashboard, a content-cluster engine, and a site auditor in one. <strong>Run it yourself, or have our team run it for you.</strong> Either way, you turn audits like this one into measurable visibility lift across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini.
    </div>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="col-block">
        <div class="col-title">How the platform works</div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Live dashboard, not monthly emails.</strong> Article moves a query, you see it the same week. Competitor publishes, you see it within days.</li>
          <li><strong>Content engineered from your audit data.</strong> Each piece is briefed from the prompts you're losing and the sources AI models actually cite.</li>
          <li><strong>Coordinated clusters, not one-offs.</strong> One topic, five surfaces (LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora, X) — same brief, reinforcing citations.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-block">
        <div class="col-title">What you'd get</div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>12+ AI-optimized articles a month</strong>, coordinated as clusters around your highest-priority queries.</li>
          <li><strong>YouTube video optimization</strong> — your existing videos restructured so AI models can extract from them.</li>
          <li><strong>Website AI-readability audit</strong> (one-time engagement) — highest-impact technical wins.</li>
          <li><strong>Tracking + competitor alerts</strong> across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-action">
      <div class="ask">Reply to this email to set up a 20-minute call — <strong>or start a self-serve trial below.</strong></div>
      <div class="links">
        {% if cta_url %}<div><span class="label">Platform</span><a href="{{ cta_url }}">{{ cta_url }}</a></div>{% endif %}
        {% if cta_email %}<div><span class="label">Email</span><a href="mailto:{{ cta_email }}">{{ cta_email }}</a></div>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

